#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:4 51ea33af8851471c85e6f472fd8e5ec4
msgid "开始之前"
msgstr "Before you contribute"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:6 8d2bcec75f68483ea3ffe214bcfb59a6
msgid "可以从问题复现、文档、翻译、示例或源码改进开始。先确定改动属于哪个仓库，再准备对应的环境。"
msgstr ""
"You can contribute reproductions, documentation, translations, examples, or code improvements. "
"Start by identifying the repository that owns the change, then prepare the environment you need."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:9 7af0dc6ee08c4625ba2df349ff06976b
msgid "选择贡献位置"
msgstr "Choose the right repository"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:14 67afcbe8a7614d87bcf0de632317ef9c
msgid "内容"
msgstr "Content"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:15 59b3c75c1d204a4d92695e273307ae3d
msgid "维护位置"
msgstr "Where to contribute"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:16 0d8a080edbd84b2e99a9ed274dd29bb2
msgid "插件行为、编辑器集成与测试场景"
msgstr "Plugin behavior, editor integration, and test scenes"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:17 78874593eb5443239a0d7b7e1d08bc54
msgid "`Godot-FmodPlayer <https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/Godot-FmodPlayer>`_ 的源码和 ``tests/``"
msgstr ""
"Source code and ``tests/`` in `Godot-FmodPlayer <https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/Godot-"
"FmodPlayer>`_"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:18 13819bf206544e9ea00ab5132899fba9
msgid "入门指南、使用说明与英文手册"
msgstr "Getting-started guides, user guides, and the English manual"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:19 949d438d11e5413da6a8cd585dc9d1b4
msgid ""
"`文档仓库 <https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/godot-fmodplayer-docs>`_ 的 ``source/`` 和 "
"``locales/en/LC_MESSAGES/``"
msgstr ""
"``source/`` and ``locales/en/LC_MESSAGES/`` in the `documentation repository "
"<https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/godot-fmodplayer-docs>`_"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:20 d0c0bfab5add46cb92ef60d59ae41f11
msgid "API 英文描述与中文类帮助"
msgstr "English API descriptions and Chinese class help"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:21 ef8404bbf11140e8bc132b0e944f933a
msgid "插件仓库的 ``doc_classes/*.xml`` 和 ``addons/fmod_player/translations/documentation/zh_CN.po``"
msgstr ""
"``doc_classes/*.xml`` and ``addons/fmod_player/translations/documentation/zh_CN.po`` in the "
"plugin repository"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:23 53637d6461664c6093d3868097e1b82d
msgid ""
"修改指南或手册翻译只需要文档环境，不必先编译插件。修改插件源码参见 :doc:`development`；验证改动参见 :doc:`testing`；翻译与类参考维护参见 "
":doc:`translation`。"
msgstr ""
"Guide and manual translation changes only require the documentation environment; you do not need "
"to build the plugin first. See :doc:`development` for plugin development, :doc:`testing` for "
"validation, and :doc:`translation` for translations and class-reference maintenance."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:26 a891e6da4b1f4424adc1e2cf149a0266
msgid "报告问题"
msgstr "Report a problem"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:28 5435bc8e2c5949e3ae2f1a85bbb76614
msgid "提交 Issue 前先搜索现有讨论。播放、导入、空间音频或导出问题，尽量附上可直接打开的最小 Godot 项目，并写清以下信息："
msgstr ""
"Search existing discussions before opening an issue. For playback, import, spatial audio, or "
"export problems, provide a minimal Godot project when possible and include:"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:30 4d54542b71c740ad887a1c20d22cb6e7
msgid "Godot 与 FMOD 版本、插件版本或提交号，以及操作系统和架构。"
msgstr "The Godot and FMOD versions, plugin version or commit, operating system, and architecture."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:31 0c16a2e3bfcd462b95cef2e0b42601fa
msgid "可以重复执行的操作步骤、预期结果和实际结果。"
msgstr "Repeatable steps, the expected result, and the actual result."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:32 2b646f0b8db8440ba8a8e8dbfbb5e2c0
msgid "相关输出日志；界面问题附截图，音频问题说明音频格式、加载方式及总线和效果器配置。"
msgstr ""
"Relevant logs; screenshots for interface problems, and the audio format, loading mode, bus setup,"
" and effects for audio problems."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:35 3af2a89d2d8c4c638609027200c1c460
msgid "准备 Pull Request"
msgstr "Prepare a pull request"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:37 47d9396973244f16b2e9d6e64d5407f9
msgid "较大的功能或接口调整先在 Issue 中说明使用场景和实现方向。"
msgstr "Discuss the use case and approach in an issue before making a large feature or API change."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:38 cfb2632d03264704be77631afc4282fc
msgid "每个 PR 聚焦一个问题，保留有助于审查的相关文档和测试改动。"
msgstr ""
"Keep each PR focused on one problem and include related documentation and tests that help review "
"it."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:39 aee3d0ae12e24a9d9201578a77243f75
msgid "描述触发条件、改动后的行为和验证方式，列出实际测试的平台及尚未验证的部分。"
msgstr ""
"Describe the trigger, resulting behavior, and validation. List the platforms actually tested and "
"any remaining gaps."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:40 40d577472e0749569c6c57c94bc34563
msgid "API 变更同步更新绑定、XML 描述、翻译及相关示例；跨仓库修改互相链接对应 PR。"
msgstr ""
"For API changes, update bindings, XML descriptions, translations, and affected examples. Link "
"companion PRs when a change spans repositories."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:41 17679578e8904afe9007bfffa625a166
msgid "性能改动提供相同配置和工作负载下的前后测量，并确认音频正确性。"
msgstr ""
"For performance changes, provide before-and-after measurements with the same configuration and "
"workload, and verify audio correctness."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:44 7f5d01ee8ea54fb5a5a2ed5e07e2e3e1
msgid "保持提交清晰"
msgstr "Keep patches focused"

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:46 da334bec2b3044f1b7f6a4b1ff2e7620
msgid "沿用现有代码风格，避免把无关重构或整库格式化混入功能修复。不要提交本机的 ``custom.py``、SDK 文件、FMOD 运行库、``tests/addons/``、日志、缓存和临时生成结果。"
msgstr ""
"Follow the existing code style and keep unrelated refactoring or repository-wide formatting out "
"of a feature or fix. Exclude local ``custom.py`` files, SDK files, FMOD runtimes, "
"``tests/addons/``, logs, caches, and temporary outputs."

#: ../../source/contributing/before_you_start.rst:48 ae0618c6a68549e9b3ad8b2619279f9e
msgid "插件使用 MIT 许可证，FMOD 单独授权。贡献内容需遵守项目许可，SDK 头文件、库文件和运行库由使用者自行取得。许可入口见 :ref:`faq-plugin-license`。"
msgstr ""
"The plugin uses the MIT license; FMOD is licensed separately. Contributions must follow the "
"project license, and users obtain SDK headers, libraries, and runtimes themselves. See :ref:`faq-"
"plugin-license` for licensing links."
